    "The Last Hour…" : {
      "comment" : "Item in the Clear History menu on the History page.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "过去一小时…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Zigzag name, the app icon and the logo are trademarks of Zigao Wang, all rights reserved. They aren’t covered by the Apache License: see [TRADEMARKS.md](TRADEMARKS.md)." : {
      "comment" : "In the Acknowledgments window. Keep the Markdown link [TRADEMARKS.md](TRADEMARKS.md) as it is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 名称、App 图标和标志是 Zigao Wang 的商标，保留所有权利。它们不在 Apache License 的授权范围内：请参阅 [TRADEMARKS.md](TRADEMARKS.md)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cache makes pages load faster. Cookies keep you signed in." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Website data” in Settings › Privacy.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "缓存能让页面载入更快。Cookie 能让你保持登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection dropped" : {
      "comment" : "Why a download failed, under its name in the downloads panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接已中断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file isn’t protected: anyone who opens it can read every password. Keep it somewhere safe and delete it when you’re done." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that confirms exporting passwords.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该文件未受保护：任何打开它的人都能读取所有密码。请把它存放在安全的地方，用完后删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file still holds your passwords unprotected. It’s safer to move it to the Trash." : {
      "comment" : "Import window, after passwords came over from an exported file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该文件中的密码仍未受保护。将它移到废纸篓会更安全。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The free encyclopedia" : {
      "comment" : "Wikipedia’s tagline, on a sample page in the welcome window’s picture of Zigzag.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自由的百科全书"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language you read." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Translate pages into” in Settings › Translation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你阅读时使用的语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page belongs to an extension that has been removed or turned off. Turn it back on in Settings › Extensions, or close this tab." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此页面属于一个已被移除或关闭的扩展。请在“设置 › 扩展”中重新打开它，或者关闭此标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page meets the window’s edges instead of floating inside it." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Borderless page” in Settings › General.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "页面直接贴合窗口边缘，而不是浮在窗口中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pages you’ve visited, used for suggestions in the command bar." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “History” in Settings › Privacy.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你访问过的页面，用于命令栏中的建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The secure connection was cut off, often by the network you’re on. Try again, or try another network." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安全连接被切断了，通常是你所在的网络造成的。请再试一次，或换一个网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site couldn’t send it" : {
      "comment" : "Why a download failed, under its name in the downloads panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站无法发送该文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site didn’t respond in time. Try again in a moment." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站没有及时响应。请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site may be down right now. Try again in a moment." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站现在可能无法访问。请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site only opens for Macs with a certificate it trusts, often one from work or school." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站只对带有它信任的证书的 Mac 开放，这种证书通常来自工作单位或学校。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site refused it" : {
      "comment" : "Why a download failed, under its name in the downloads panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站拒绝了该请求"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site’s certificate has expired, or your Mac’s date and time are wrong." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站的证书已过期，或者你 Mac 的日期和时间不正确。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site’s certificate is for a different address, or can’t be trusted. Someone could be pretending to be this site." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站的证书属于另一个地址，或者不可信。可能有人在冒充这个网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site’s certificate isn’t valid yet. Check your Mac’s date and time." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站的证书尚未生效。请检查你 Mac 的日期和时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site’s certificate wasn’t issued by anyone your Mac trusts. Sites on your own network, like a router, often look like this." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站的证书不是由你的 Mac 信任的机构颁发的。你自己网络上的网站（比如路由器）常常是这样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They leave the sidebar. Type a few letters in the address bar to bring one back." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Archive tabs you haven’t used” in Settings › General.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它们会从边栏中移走。在地址栏中键入几个字母即可找回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They’re forgotten on this Mac. Tabs, pinned tabs and passwords stay." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that asks before removing pages a search found from History.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 会忘掉它们。标签页、已固定标签页和密码会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Things appear in place instead of sliding or growing. Fades stay." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Reduce motion” in Settings › General.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内容直接出现，而不是滑入或放大。淡入淡出效果保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Site" : {
      "comment" : "Section label over the site's settings in the site panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This afternoon" : {
      "comment" : "Name of a History session that began today.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天下午"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build doesn’t update itself. Release builds of Zigzag update automatically." : {
      "comment" : "Toast after Check for Updates in a development build.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
