            "value" : "你的密码存储在 Zigzag 中，保存在你 Mac 的钥匙串里，并通过 iCloud 钥匙串同步。可以在“Zigzag › 密码”中找到它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your sign-ins from %@ couldn’t come over, so sites will ask you to sign in again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. The placeholder is a browser's name, like Chrome. Sign-ins are the sites a browser keeps you signed in to.",
      "localizations" : {
