          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你将在所有网站上退出登录。你的密码、已固定标签页和历史记录会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re all set" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the Import window when the import is done.\nTitle of the getting-started guide, a card in the window once every step is done.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一切就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re offline" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.\nWhy a download failed, under its name in the downloads panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你已离线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re signed in to your sites here too, and everything else is in your sidebar. You can bring more over anytime from Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Import window when the import is done and sign-ins came over.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在这里也已登录你的网站，其他所有内容都在你的边栏中。你可以随时从“设置”导入更多内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigao, who makes Zigzag" : {
      "comment" : "Signature under the thank-you note at the end of the getting-started guide, a card in the window. Zigao is the maker's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigao，Zigzag 的作者"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag Mini" : {
      "comment" : "The name of Zigzag's small window for one page, without the sidebar (Arc called it Little Arc). Kept in Latin letters, like the app's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag Mini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag Passwords.csv" : {
      "comment" : "The file name suggested when exporting passwords. Keep .csv.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 密码.csv"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag can’t open this address" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 无法打开此地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag can’t read this file" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 无法读取此文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag can’t read your card. Allow it in System Settings › Privacy › Contacts, and set My Card in Contacts." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when filling a form from Contacts isn't allowed. System Settings › Privacy › Contacts and My Card are names macOS uses; match them.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 无法读取你的名片。请在“系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 通讯录”中允许访问，并在“通讯录”中设置“我的名片”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t move it to the Trash. Show it in Finder and delete it there." : {
      "comment" : "Import window, when the exported passwords file couldn't be moved to the Trash.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 未能将它移到废纸篓。请在“访达”中显示它，然后在那里删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t open %@’s passwords. Quit %@, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. The placeholder is a browser's name, like Chrome.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Zigzag couldn’t open %1$@’s passwords. Quit %2$@, then try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 未能打开 %1$@ 的密码。请退出 %2$@，然后再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t read Arc’s history. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. Arc is a browser's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 未能读取 Arc 的历史记录。请再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t read Arc’s spaces and pinned tabs. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. Arc is a browser's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 未能读取 Arc 的空间和已固定标签页。请再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t read the passwords it already has, so it didn’t add any. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 未能读取它已有的密码，所以没有添加任何密码。请再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t save your tabs and spaces" : {
      "comment" : "Toast when Zigzag can't write its library of spaces and tabs; a reason may follow as its own sentence.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 未能存储你的标签页和空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag follows your Mac’s language unless you pick one here." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Language” in Settings › General.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 跟随你的 Mac 的语言，除非你在这里另选一种。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag has a blocker built in. Pages load faster, with fewer trackers." : {
      "comment" : "Line under the title of the welcome window’s ad blocking step.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 内置了拦截器。页面载入更快，跟踪器更少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag is made by Zigao Wang and is open source under the Apache License, Version 2.0. It builds on the work of others, listed below with their licenses. Thank you." : {
      "comment" : "First paragraph of the Acknowledgments window. “Apache License, Version 2.0” is the license's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 由 Zigao Wang 制作，依据 Apache License, Version 2.0 开源。它建立在他人的成果之上，下面列出了这些作品及其许可证。谢谢你们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag is your default browser" : {
      "comment" : "In Settings › General, in place of Set as Default once it's done.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 是你的默认浏览器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag isn’t allowed to save in that folder" : {
      "comment" : "Why a file couldn't be saved, said after what failed, like “Couldn’t save the page. Not enough space on your Mac.”",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 无权存储到该文件夹"
